ornament.

reduce_transparency rewrites the theme background to full alpha at startup
(card, dock, box panels, label pills all draw solid), lifts the OPTIONS
boxes' panel/zebra alpha to 1.0 (box_panel_alpha()), and swaps the bar's
see-through strip for the same opaque slab the boxes use, hard-edged.
